      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "You don’t want a stale performance. If it is not coming out after a few takes... Do not force it! Take a step back, take a break. Attempting it Fresh will always be in your best interest."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "It is always painfully clear when an actor has done 10 or more takes in a Self Tape. It loses all it’s magic."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Over rehearsed is a COMMON COMPLAINT of Casting Directors."
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Being Prepared is not the same as Over Rehearsed!",
          "align": "center"
        }
      ]
