        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "I’ve seen situations where Child Actor’s felt inhibited because of judgement by other Family Members within earshot."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Also filming after the family has gone to bed make the actor fearful of giving as much energy as they may need to give in their taped audition."
        }
